    why_wrong=["Rapid regrowth after complete surgery is a typical indication for aspirin therapy, not a contraindication.",
               "Coexisting allergic rhinitis is common and does not prevent desensitization.",
               "Correct.",
               "Controller asthma medications are expected and are usually continued through desensitization."],
